estricted to root mode 0600 and removed by cmd-e75b247333af40a0, so it was reverted with no evidenced final residue. No other state-changing command lacked a clear task, prerequisite, bounded-evidence, restart-protocol, or restoration role.","evidence_ids":["cmd-ef4b9f424aba430f","cmd-e75b247333af40a0","cmd-72d463c9a3794415","cmd-dd58718424eb4a27","cmd-049c638738bf447c","cmd-622fb9ab32da4b2e","cmd-7254595d63764981","cmd-b64853fa2c8a4c25","cmd-e5fc12ecac104a01","cmd-5700fe9818b340bc","cmd-d45410bd47e54dfc","cmd-cddbd297c82a46be","cmd-c81828dcae1c4f4b","cmd-1445a7b39ff14445","cmd-f3885926413f4b48","global:before_prepare:node1:boot-identity","global:before_prepare:node2:boot-identity","global:before_prepare:node3:boot-identity","global:after_executor:node1:boot-identity","global:after_executor:node2:boot-identity","global:after_executor:node3:boot-identity","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node2:failed-services","global:after_executor:node3:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:package-health","global:after_executor:node2:package-health","global:after_executor:node3:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied with direct behavioral evidence. Redis began with node1 primary, Sentinel automatically promoted node2 during a bounded node1 outage, node1 returned synchronized, authenticated TLS worked on both required ports, and the proof data survived failover and all mandated node restarts. Restart evidence is complete and agrees with fixed lifecycle observations. Hygiene was high, with one short-lived, root-protected plaintext-password file identified as unnecessary and subsequently removed.","limitations":["Lifecycle snapshots are bounded to boot identity, sockets, /tmp, failed services, and package consistency; they do not independently inventory all files under /etc/redis or /root, so final PKI-artifact cleanup beyond the specifically observed commands is not globally cross-checked.","The negat